"Years later she and Liren Vail meet the Heirs at Driftmere and guide them across Ostren."
"She first takes Nathan Lark for a monk with an odd vow."
"She drives the Heirs' carriage and calls Ostren the locus of culture on Davrar."
"She shares Questor secrets freely, reasoning that no warning from Davrar means it agrees."
"In the Ostren war an Aleph fireball kills her, and Khachi resurrects her."
